# Project artifacts. Everything under artifacts/ is regenerable working output
# and stays out of the repo, except the stow reference set below: the extracted
# operator and the trained hole policy are inputs to stages 2 and 4, so a fresh
# clone can run those without first reproducing stages 1 and 3.
data/
artifacts/*
!artifacts/stow/
artifacts/stow/*
!artifacts/stow/*.json
!artifacts/stow/stage3/
artifacts/stow/stage3/*
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/
artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/*
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/sac_hole_best.zip
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/summary.json
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/precondition.json
# Drawer: the small JSON results (gate, operator, plan, hole spec) are tracked,
# and so is every Stage 3 run's configuration, summary and evaluation, with the
# checkpoint checksums in stage3/checkpoints.json. Checkpoints and videos are
# kept outside normal Git (see stage3/checkpoints.json for how to verify a copy).
!artifacts/drawer/
artifacts/drawer/*
!artifacts/drawer/*.json
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/
artifacts/drawer/stage3/*
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/*.json
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/*/
artifacts/drawer/stage3/*/*
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/*/*.json
# Direct baseline (targeted versus direct learning): tracked the same way, plus
# its learning-curve figure; checkpoints and videos stay outside normal Git.
!artifacts/drawer/direct/
artifacts/drawer/direct/*
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*.json
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*.png
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*/
artifacts/drawer/direct/*/*
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*/*.json
# The paper's figure and table, with the exact data behind them.
!artifacts/drawer/paper/
checkpoints/
logs/
wandb/
runs/
outputs/

